# This repo is edited on Windows and every byte it produces is consumed on
# Linux: shell scripts run in pods and on the Proxmox node, and YAML is parsed
# by Kubernetes. A CRLF in a .sh is a script bash will not parse.
*        text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
